---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "VOW — Premium event & guest technology"
description: "B2B2VIP technology connecting the teams behind extraordinary events with the guests at the heart of them."
styles: [home, ecosystem]
scripts: [hero-gradient, segments, sectors, cards, reel, ecosystem]
motion: [hero, reveal, hover, depth, marquee, cta, ecosystem]
---

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
    <canvas id="heroCanvas"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero-body">
    <div class="stage">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-hero="eyebrow">B2B2VIP</p>
      <h1 class="display" id="hero-title">
        <span data-hero="line">The Operating System for</span>
        <span data-hero="line">Premium Live Experiences.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede" data-hero="sub">One connected platform to orchestrate high-stakes events, personalize every journey and strengthen every relationship.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a href="/contact/#demo" class="btn btn-primary" data-hero="cta">Book DEMO</a>
      <a href="#platform" class="btn btn-ghost" data-hero="cta">Meet VOW</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Client logos: transparent strip so the hero gradient shows through -->
  <div class="logo-marquee" id="logoMarquee">
    <ul class="logos" aria-label="Clients">
      <li style="--h:54"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/1199%20logo.png" alt="1199SEIU Funds" width="400" height="308" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:26"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/Alvin%20Ailey%20logo.png" alt="Alvin Ailey" width="400" height="88" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:38"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/Assembly%20logo.png" alt="Assembly" width="400" height="184" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:46"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/IGlaad%20Media%20logo.png" alt="GLAAD" width="400" height="224" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:37"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/Kind%20logo.png" alt="KIND, Kids in Need of Defense" width="400" height="168" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:56"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/NBC%20logo.png" alt="NBC" width="320" height="320" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:34"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/NYU%20logo.png" alt="NYU" width="400" height="148" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:34"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/PFL%20logo.png" alt="PFL" width="400" height="152" decoding="async"></li>
      <li style="--h:32"><img src="/assets/clients_logos/Tony%20logo.png" alt="Tony Awards" width="400" height="132" decoding="async"></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <button type="button" class="motion-toggle" data-motion-toggle="icon" aria-label="Pause Motion" hidden>
    <svg class="i-pause" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v10M11 3v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
    <svg class="i-play" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3.5 12.5 8 5 12.5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
  </button>
  <div class="hero-foot" data-hero="foot">
    <a href="#perspective" class="cue" aria-label="Scroll down"><b aria-hidden="true"></b></a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Market segments: a rotating row; the second list only closes the loop -->
{%- set markets = ["Media", "Entertainment", "Philanthropy", "Corporate", "Sports", "Olympics", "Grand Scale"] %}
<section class="segments" aria-label="Markets we serve">
  <div class="seg-track">
    <ul>
      {%- for m in markets %}
      <li>{{ m }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <ul aria-hidden="true">
      {%- for m in markets %}
      <li>{{ m }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The VOW perspective -->
<section class="section persp" id="perspective" aria-labelledby="persp-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <h2 class="h2" id="persp-title">Exceptional Experiences. Connected Teams.</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="lede">Premium, VIP and high-stakes events call for care at every level. VOW brings key staff, external collaborators and stakeholders together in one real-time environment.</p>
      <ul class="outcomes">
        <li><strong>Retire the Spreadsheets</strong><span>Guest lists, groups and logistics in one live source of truth.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Automate the Busywork</strong><span>Reminders, confirmations and follow-ups run on their own.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Connect Your Systems</strong><span>Work across the apps and legacy tools you already use.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Keep Everyone Aligned</strong><span>Fewer email chains and text threads to coordinate each detail.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Products -->
<section class="section products" id="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="platform-title">Behind the Scenes. At the Heart of the Experience.</h2>
      <p class="lede">One platform, two perspectives: VOW PRO for the team running the event, VOW GO for every guest attending it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prod-grid">
      <article class="prod pro" aria-labelledby="pro-title">
        <div class="prod-visual">
          <img class="bg" src="/assets/img/product-pro.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <picture><source srcset="/assets/img/product/pro-dashboard.avif" type="image/avif"><img src="/assets/img/product/pro-dashboard.webp" alt="VOW PRO on a laptop: an event seating map beside a guest list with seat assignments" width="1400" height="821" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
        </div>
        <p class="for">For the people making it happen</p>
        <h3 id="pro-title" translate="no"><b>VOW</b> PRO</h3>
        <p>Plan with precision. Coordinate teams, manage guests and run the event with a shared view of every detail.</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>Guest, group and host management</li>
          <li>RSVP, signup and registration</li>
          <li>Real-time communications hub</li>
          <li>Alerts and notifications</li>
          <li>Speakers, sponsors and more</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact/#demo" class="link">Book a VOW PRO Demo <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow-ne"/></svg></a>
      </article>

      <article class="prod go" aria-labelledby="go-title">
        <div class="prod-visual">
          <img class="bg" src="/assets/img/product-go.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <picture><source srcset="/assets/img/product/go-access-pass.avif" type="image/avif"><img src="/assets/img/product/go-access-pass.webp" alt="VOW GO on two phones: a guest’s event home screen and a digital access pass with a QR code" width="900" height="1153" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
        </div>
        <p class="for">For the people experiencing it</p>
        <h3 id="go-title" translate="no"><b>VOW</b> GO</h3>
        <p>Give each guest a considered, connected experience — with their event details, personal schedule, access and support close at hand.</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>Personal schedules</li>
          <li>Digital passes</li>
          <li>Live updates</li>
          <li>Concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact/#demo" class="link">Book a VOW GO Demo <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow-ne"/></svg></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Services -->
<section class="section services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="services-title">Every Touchpoint, Covered.</h2>
      <p class="lede">From the first invitation to the ride home, VOW supports each moment of the guest journey — and the team behind it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile lead">
        <div class="tile-visual">
          <img class="bg" src="/assets/img/service-guest-app.jpg" alt="" width="1536" height="1920" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <picture><source srcset="/assets/img/product/go-access-pass.avif" type="image/avif"><img src="/assets/img/product/go-access-pass.webp" alt="VOW GO on two phones: a guest’s event home screen and a digital access pass with a QR code" width="900" height="1153" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
        </div>
        <h3>Web and Mobile Guest Experience App</h3>
        <p>Each guest’s schedule, passes, updates and support in one place, on web or mobile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile"><h3>Arrival, Check-In and Departure</h3><p>Coordinate cars, doors and departures so every arrival feels expected.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><h3>Digital Tickets and Access Passes</h3><p>Issue, update and revoke credentials in real time.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><h3>White Glove Pro and Guest Support</h3><p>Dedicated help for your team before and during the event, and for guests on the night.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><h3>Transactions and Payments</h3><p>Take payments and handle purchases inside the same guest experience.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Sectors -->
<section class="section sectors" id="sectors" aria-labelledby="sectors-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHO WE SERVE</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="sectors-title"><span>Five worlds, one standard.</span> <span class="accent">A unified solution.</span></h2>
      <p class="lede">Explore each ecosystem using the eye icon.</p>
      <figure class="sector-frame" id="sectorFrame" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- for s in sectors %}
        <img{% if loop.first %} class="on"{% endif %} data-key="{{ s.slug }}" src="{{ s.image }}" alt="" width="{{ s.imageW }}" height="{{ s.imageH }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        {%- endfor %}
      </figure>
    </div>
    <ul class="sector-list">
      {%- for s in sectors %}
      <li class="sector{% if loop.first %} on{% endif %}" data-key="{{ s.slug }}">
        <img class="thumb" src="{{ s.image }}" alt="" width="128" height="128" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <h3 class="name"><a href="/sectors/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a></h3>
        <p class="desc">{{ s.line }}</p>
        <div class="peek">
          <button type="button" class="eye" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="peek-{{ s.slug }}" aria-label="About {{ s.name }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.6-6.5 10-6.5S22 12 22 12s-3.6 6.5-10 6.5S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></button>
          <div class="pop" id="peek-{{ s.slug }}">
            <p class="pop-title">{{ s.name }}</p>
            <p>{{ s.description }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Proof -->
<section class="section proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
  <div class="wrap proof-inner">
    <h2 class="sr-only" id="proof-title">What Clients Say</h2>
    {% include "testimonial.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Case studies reel -->
<section class="section cases" id="cases" aria-labelledby="cases-title" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap head">
    <h2 class="h2" id="cases-title">Case Studies</h2>
    <div class="arrows">
      <button type="button" aria-label="Previous case study" data-dir="-1" aria-controls="reel"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3 5 8l5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" aria-label="Next case study" data-dir="1" aria-controls="reel"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 3 5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reel" id="reel" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Case studies, scrollable">
    <article class="case feature">
      <div class="field"><img src="/assets/img/case-team-usa.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
      <div class="info">
        <h3>Team USA × VOW</h3>
        <p>An interactive concept for event operations and guest experiences.</p>
        <!-- TODO: replace with the live demo URL -->
        <div class="case-links">
          <a href="/case-studies/team-usa/" class="link">Read the Case Study <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow-ne"/></svg></a>
          <a href="/contact/#demo" class="link">Request the Demo <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow-ne"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="case soon"><div class="field"><img src="/assets/img/case-entertainment.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Coming soon</span></div><div class="info"><h3>Media &amp; Entertainment</h3><p>A case study from the world of premieres, upfronts and award shows.</p></div></article>
    <article class="case soon"><div class="field"><img src="/assets/img/case-philanthropy.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Coming soon</span></div><div class="info"><h3>Philanthropy &amp; Nonprofits</h3><p>A case study from the world of galas and donor events.</p></div></article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Ecosystem -->
{% set eco = ecosystem.home %}
{% include "ecosystem.njk" %}

<!-- Final CTA -->

{% include "cta.njk" %}
